# Nothing but the runtime needs enters the image (Phase 7). In particular: no environment files,
# no local databases, no tests, no scripts, no transcripts, no virtualenvs, no git history.
*
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!app/
!migrations/
# Operator target only (Dockerfile `ops` stage); the serving stage never copies these.
!scripts/__init__.py
!scripts/data_retention.py
!scripts/verify_migrations.py
app/**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
